    "details": "Gitlab reports:\n\n> Integer Overflow issue in Regular Expression Compiler impacts GitLab\n> CE/EE\n>\n> Improper Authentication issue in OmniAuth-to-LDAP auto-linking email\n> lookup impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Cache Poisoning issue in OAuth/OIDC discovery endpoints impacts GitLab\n> CE/EE\n>\n> Improper Access Control issue in GraphQL work item email address field\n> impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incomplete enforcement of instance-wide SAML/LDAP membership lock\n> allows unauthorized member additions in GitLab EE\n>\n> Internal Credential Exposure issue in internal response headers\n> impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Authorization Bypass Through User-Controlled Key issue in group\n> milestones API impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Use of Less Trusted Source issue in AI Gateway feature enablement\n> header impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Use of Cache Containing Sensitive Information issue in merge request\n> title rendering impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Improper Access Control issue in merge request approval policy\n> enforcement impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Improper Cleanup on Thrown Exception issue in security findings\n> impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Improper Access Control issue in group Duo admin-lock enforcement for\n> Amazon Q settings impacts GitLab EE\n",
